  dialogues:
  - hasAChoice: 0
    lines:
    - You're wasting your time.
    - After all, you're only a child.
    - Leave me alone!
  - hasAChoice: 0
    lines:
    - I can't believe I have to stay here alone with the body.
    - 'But even a corpse is better company than certain people. '
  - hasAChoice: 0
    lines:
    - I don't even care anymore what happens with me.
    - But I'm worried about my mom.
